      "change": "+3.35% d/d ($+3.54 vs $105.72 May 14); weekly +~8%",
      "tooltip": "Brent rallied $3.54 on Friday May 15 to $109.26 as Hormuz seizures (5/14 Fujairah tanker + Indian cargo ship sunk off Oman) compounded the Trump-Xi summit no-breakthrough close. IEA: market may remain undersupplied through October even if war ends. Energy was sole green S&P sector (+1.6%) on Friday. Sources: Reuters / Yahoo Finance / TradingEconomics / NYMEX/ICE."
